    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564">

                <pb facs="0674" n="588" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg588"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Combs to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States,<lb/>Guatemala and
                                Honduras</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-04-17"><hi rendition="#italic">April 17,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: On the evening of the 14th instant the
                    President of Guatemala gave a dinner of about sixty covers in honor of the
                    diplomatic corps.</p>
                <p>In the absence of the Spanish minister it became my duty to respond to the
                    remarks of the President.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to attach hereto a copy of the few words spoken on the
                    occasion.</p>
                <p>The President afterwards expressed gratification at their tone.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Leslie Combs.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d564-a1.xml" xpointer="d564-a1"/>
            </div>
